  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multiprofile configurations with scvi_n200 RNA encoder (config_005, 0.6501 accuracy) outperform singleprofile and PCA-based models. This experiment tests the logical extension of combining the best RNA-only setup (scvi_n200, multiprofile, avgpool) with image data using concat fusion. It isolates the impact of multimodal integration while keeping other components consistent, addressing the key uncertainty about whether adding image data improves performance. This balances exploitation of proven RNA-only strengths with exploration of multimodal potential."
}

